    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "HR 100-150/min; P waves visible w normal morphology preceding each QRS; gradual onset. tx the UNDERLYING CAUSE (pain, anxiety, fever, hypovolemia, anemia, hyperthyroidism, pulm embolism, meds) - NOT the rate. Rate control meds are inappropriate & potentially harmful for sinus tachycardia."
     }
    ]
